substring filter in dialog-session-list): (1) child sessions included
in results (ref excludes non-root); (2) fuzzy matches (loginredirect /
zln match on ours, nothing on ref); (3) whitespace-only query returns
EMPTY on ours vs the full list on ref; (4) no query trim; (5)
accent-insensitive matching vs ref's byte-exact. Artifact:
/tmp/opencode/scanef2/e12-second-pass.md. Disposition: per-cell product
decision (match ref's session-list predicate, or keep fuzzy as a
deliberate improvement — then it must be dispositioned as ours-extra
by design). Also rides E1's search-in-10k disposition: ours has NO
in-transcript search surface at all (E12 [G] names it; ref-side
